Give the DiskANN node caches a mixing hash.

_nhood_cache and _coord_cache are tsl::robin_map<uint32_t, ...> with no Hash
template argument, so Hash defaults to std::hash<uint32_t>, which is the
identity function on libstdc++. robin_map masks the hash to a power-of-two
bucket count, so a node id reaches its bucket with zero mixing: a dense,
contiguous block of ids folds onto a dense, contiguous block of buckets.

DiskANN's generate_cache_list_from_sample_queries only ever visits a fraction
of the graph (~2.78M of 100M nodes on SIFT100M), and pads any larger requested
cache with structurally clustered zero-visit "filler" ids. Those fold badly,
producing robin-hood displacement chains in the thousands. robin_map's own
anti-clustering rehash does not rescue it, because that escape hatch requires
load_factor() >= 0.15 and the affected cache sizes land at 0.1490118.

Measured on SIFT100M: average find() probe distance 0.469 at 1M cached nodes,
9330.23 at 5M, 5399.26 at 10M, 0.000 at 25M. QPS drops from 158 to 114 at 5M
despite disk I/O continuing to fall.

A mixing hash removes the folding mechanism regardless of how the cache list's
filler ids happen to be distributed.

--- a/include/pq_flash_index.h
+++ b/include/pq_flash_index.h
@@ -21,6 +21,25 @@
 namespace diskann
 {

+// ann-suite research patch: see the header of robin_map_hash_fix.patch.
+// std::hash<uint32_t> is the identity function on libstdc++, and robin_map
+// masks to a power-of-two bucket count, so raw node ids reach buckets with no
+// mixing at all. This applies a murmur3-style finalizer first so that a dense
+// block of node ids cannot fold onto a dense block of buckets.
+struct AnnSuiteNodeIdHash
+{
+    inline size_t operator()(const uint32_t key) const
+    {
+        uint64_t x = (uint64_t)key;
+        x ^= x >> 33;
+        x *= 0xff51afd7ed558ccdULL;
+        x ^= x >> 33;
+        x *= 0xc4ceb9fe1a85ec53ULL;
+        x ^= x >> 33;
+        return (size_t)x;
+    }
+};
+
 template <typename T, typename LabelT = uint32_t> class PQFlashIndex
 {
   public:
@@ -208,11 +227,11 @@

     // nhood_cache; the uint32_t in nhood_Cache are offsets into nhood_cache_buf
     unsigned *_nhood_cache_buf = nullptr;
-    tsl::robin_map<uint32_t, std::pair<uint32_t, uint32_t *>> _nhood_cache;
+    tsl::robin_map<uint32_t, std::pair<uint32_t, uint32_t *>, AnnSuiteNodeIdHash> _nhood_cache;

     // coord_cache; The T* in coord_cache are offsets into coord_cache_buf
     T *_coord_cache_buf = nullptr;
-    tsl::robin_map<uint32_t, T *> _coord_cache;
+    tsl::robin_map<uint32_t, T *, AnnSuiteNodeIdHash> _coord_cache;

     // thread-specific scratch
     ConcurrentQueue<SSDThreadData<T> *> _thread_data;
